-- =====================================================================
-- Session 155 — Matt 23 extras-tier cross-references (single chapter)
-- =====================================================================
-- Adds Matt 23''s extras-tier rows + threads to the cross-reference
-- corpus. Continues the S131 (Matt 1-2) -> S154 (Matt 17) extras-tier
-- coverage; Matt 23 lands as the load-bearing-framework chapter where
-- the diagnostic-architecture *Pharisaic-leadership-system = first
-- costume of the antichrist architecture* is grounded most directly in
-- the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel)''s own words. The chapter walks the
-- seven-woes-substance against the leadership-substance of the
-- Second-Temple in three movements (introduction at vv.1-12 + the
-- seven-woes-cluster at vv.13-36 + the lament-over-Yerushalayim
-- (Jerusalem) at vv.37-39); the same diagnostic-architecture operates
-- across four costumes by the framework''s contrary-to-Torah test (1
-- John 2:3-4) — Pharisees + Galatian-agitators + modern-institutional-
-- Christianity + modern-Hebrew-Roots-false-inclusion-gospel + Islam,
-- four costumes on one antichrist architecture. The seven-woes name
-- the substance of the first costume; the same substance recurs in the
-- others. The system-not-people posture is non-negotiable throughout —
-- the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) is himself a Yahudi (Jew), the
-- apostles are Yahudim (Jews), the multitudes the King-addresses at
-- v.1 are Yahudim (Jews), and the lament-substance at vv.37-39 walks
-- the gathering-substance EVEN-at-the-moment-of-the-substantial-
-- judgment of the leadership-substance the chapter has-walked-out
-- against. Five framework-bearing narrative-movements anchor the
-- chapter:
--
--   (a) the introduction at vv.1-12 — *the scribes and the Pharisees
--       sit in Mosheh''s (Moses''s) seat* + *they say, and do not* + the
--       heavy-burdens-grievous-to-be-borne the leadership-substance
--       binds on others while not-moving-them-with-one-finger (cf. Acts
--       15:10''s *yoke our fathers were not able to bear* — the
--       Pharisaic-oral-tradition-substance, NOT the Torah-substance the
--       apostles after-the-Council still-walked themselves); the
--       for-to-be-seen-of-men display of broadened-Tefillin and
--       enlarged-Tsitsit (the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) does not walk
--       against the Tefillin or the Tsitsit themselves — he walks the
--       Tsitsit himself per Matt 9:20 and 14:36 — but against the
--       *making-broad* and *enlarging* for the display-substance); the
--       love-of-the-uppermost-rooms-at-feasts and chief-seats-in-the-
--       synagogues and Rabbi-Rabbi-greetings-in-the-markets; the
--       categorical-rejection of religious-paternity-titles (*be not ye
--       called Rabbi ... call no man your father upon the earth ...
--       neither be ye called masters* — not categorically against the
--       Hebrew teaching-relationship or the natural-father-honor, but
--       against the substance-of-religious-status); the kingdom-
--       inversion-substance the King had-already-walked at Matt 18:1-5
--       and 20:25-28 (*he that is greatest among you shall be your
--       servant*). The wisdom-stream had named the kingdom-inversion-
--       and-pride-architecture across Sirach 3 + 7 + 10 + 32.
--   (b) the first three woes at vv.13-22 — the leadership-substance
--       shutting-up-the-kingdom-of-heaven-against-men (v.13, with the
--       textual-variant additional widow-devouring woe at v.14 in some
--       manuscripts); the second-woe at v.15 (*ye compass sea and land
--       to make one proselyte, and when he is made, ye make him
--       twofold more the child of Gehinnom (Gehenna) than yourselves*)
--       — the framework-major-direct-diagnostic of the false-inclusion-
--       gospel-substance, the prototype-substance the apostle-Sha''ul
--       (Paul)''s letter-to-the-Galatians and the apostolic-Council at
--       Acts 15 walked-against, the same diagnostic operating in five
--       costumes (Pharisaic-rabbinic-system through ADDITION, Galatian-
--       agitators through INVERSION, modern-institutional-Christianity
--       through SUBTRACTION, modern-Hebrew-Roots-false-inclusion through
--       COLLAPSE, Islam through TRANSFER); and the third-woe at vv.16-22
--       (*ye blind guides ... swear by the temple or the gold of the
--       temple*) walking the Pharisaic-oath-distinction-substance
--       against the Torah''s-direct-substance at Vayikra (Leviticus)
--       19:12, Bamidbar (Numbers) 30:2, and Devarim (Deuteronomy)
--       23:21-23 — the same substance the King had-already-walked at
--       Matt 5:33-37 (*swear not at all*) and the apostle-Ya''aqov
--       (James) walks at James 5:12. The wisdom-stream had named the
--       corrupted-priesthood-architecture across Testaments XII Levi
--       (chs 14-17 canonical numbering / file chs 17, 20) and the
--       false-credential-substance across 1 Enoch 99 and Wisdom of
--       Solomon 6, and the oath-substance across Sirach 23 + 27.
--   (c) the fourth-and-fifth-woes at vv.23-28 — the fourth-woe at
--       vv.23-24 (*ye pay tithe of mint and anise and cummin, and have
--       omitted the weightier matters of the law, judgment, mercy, and
--       faith*) walking the Tanakh-prophetic-summary-substance the
--       prophet-Mikhah (Micah) had-named at Mikhah (Micah) 6:8, with
--       the both-and architecture preserved at *these ought ye to have
--       done, and not to leave the other undone* — the Torah-substance
--       is one-substance walked-from-the-tithe-of-mint to the
--       substance-of-mercy, NOT either-or; and *strain at a gnat, and
--       swallow a camel* naming both unclean-animals per Vayikra
