--   (d) the seventh-woe at vv.29-36 (which extends through the
--       lament-substance) — the leadership-substance builds-the-tombs-
--       of-the-prophets the same leadership-substance''s-fathers killed
--       (*the days of our fathers*); the *fill ye up then the measure
--       of your fathers* substance walking the Tanakh-substance of
--       Bereshit (Genesis) 15:16 (*the iniquity of the Amorites is not
--       yet full*) and Devarim (Deuteronomy) 32:34-35; the *ye serpents,
--       ye generation of vipers* substance walking the seed-of-the-
--       serpent-substance from Bereshit (Genesis) 3:15 — the wheat-
--       and-tares architecture the King had-walked at Matt 13:24-30
--       and 13:36-43, the seed-war-substance walked-into-the-leadership-
--       substance, NOT the Yahudim (Jews)-as-a-people categorically;
--       the *from the blood of righteous Hevel (Abel) unto the blood
--       of Zecharyah (Zechariah) son of Berekhyahu (Barachias)*
--       substance walking the WHOLE-Tanakh-prophet-killing-pattern from
--       the first-righteous-blood at Bereshit (Genesis) 4:8-10 (with
--       the *voice of thy brother''s blood crieth from the ground*
--       substance the wisdom-stream extends at 1 Enoch 22''s spirits-of-
--       the-dead-making-suit-architecture and Hebrews 11:4 + 12:24
--       names the apostolic-substance for) through the last-prophet-
--       killing at 2 Divrei HaYamim (Chronicles) 24:20-22 closing the
--       Hebrew-canon-order; and *all these things shall come upon this
--       generation* walking-toward the 70 CE Roman destruction of the
--       Second-Temple the King will-make-explicit at the Olivet-
--       discourse-substance of Matt 24:1-2. The wisdom-stream had named
--       the Abel-blood-crying-architecture at 1 Enoch 22.
--   (e) the lament at vv.37-39 — *O Yerushalayim (Jerusalem),
--       Yerushalayim (Jerusalem), thou that killest the prophets, and
--       stonest them which are sent unto thee, how often would I have
--       gathered thy children together, even as a hen gathereth her
--       chickens under her wings, and ye would not! Behold, your house
--       is left unto you desolate. For I say unto you, Ye shall not
--       see me henceforth, till ye shall say, Blessed is he that
--       cometh in the name of Yahuah (the LORD)* — the second
--       framework-major moment of the chapter. The doubled-address
--       walks the Tanakh-tender-pattern (Avraham (Abraham), Avraham +
--       Ya''aqov (Jacob), Ya''aqov + Mosheh (Moses), Mosheh + Shemu''el
--       (Samuel), Shemu''el + Marta (Martha), Marta + Shimon (Simon),
--       Shimon + Sha''ul (Paul), Sha''ul). The mother-bird-gathering-
--       substance walks the Tanakh-substance of Devarim (Deuteronomy)
--       32:11-12 + the Tehillim (Psalms) 17:8 / 36:7 / 57:1 / 61:4 /
--       63:7 / 91:4 + Ruth 2:12 + Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 31:5. The
--       *house-left-desolate* substance walks Yirmeyahu (Jeremiah) 12:7
--       and 22:5 and the departure-of-the-Shekinah at Yechezk''el
--       (Ezekiel) 10:18-19 and 11:22-23. The *Blessed is he that
--       cometh in the name of Yahuah (the LORD)* citation from Tehillim
--       (Psalm) 118:26 walks-toward the surviving-third-substance of
--       Zekharyah (Zechariah) 13:8-9 and the look-upon-me-whom-they-
--       have-pierced substance of Zekharyah (Zechariah) 12:10. The
--       wisdom-stream had named the mother-hen-gathering-architecture
--       and the prophets-slain-and-house-desolate architecture across
--       2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 1:30-33.
--
-- Matt 23 reading-target: the chapter walks five movements with the
